# Datastar gallery

See [custom applications](/docs/applications/custom/) and
[handlers](/docs/applications/handlers/).

Ports of official Datastar interaction patterns. The server still owns HTML.
Datastar is the transport. The gallery uses an authored `main.roc` for custom
HTTP routing and SQLite for durable state.

A dedicated `datastar.examples.rocci.dev` hostname is reserved and is not
serving yet. Run the app locally. Source files are listed in the sidebar.

## Pages

| Path | Pattern |
| --- | --- |
| `/search` | Active search with `@let`, `@if`, `@for` |
| `/edit` | Click to edit with `@match` |
| `/todos` | TodoMVC filters and lists |
| `/tabs` | Lazy tabs |
| `/validate` | Inline validation |

## Run locally

```sh
cargo run -q -p rocci-cli -- run examples/rocci/custom/datastar
```

## Smoke

```sh
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/search | grep -E 'data-bind:search|Carli'
```
